gpc:10005894  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that can be described as latex/rubber/vinyl gloves used in food preparation or D.I.Y. for coverage of hands and hygienic purposes. Includes disposable gloves, powdered gloves and products which are sterile. Excludes protective handwear classified in clothing which are made of different materials such as canvas and leather and are not sterile, as well as fashion gloves, cosmetic gloves and gaming gloves."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Gloves"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:73040600 .

