        rdfs:comment     "Includes any product that can be described/observed as a fresh commercial variety of Black Mustard grown from Brassica nigra to be supplied fresh.&#160; Specifically excludes: Prepared/Processed or Unprepared/Unprocessed and Shelf Stable or Frozen Black Mustard and variety packs of black mustard mixed with other items."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Black Mustard"@en;
