        rdfs:comment     "Includes any product that can be described/observed as a fresh commercial variety of Squash, Calabaza, grown from Cucurbite moschata , to be supplied fresh. Specifically excludes: Prepared/Processed or Unprepared/Unprocessed and Shelf Stable or Frozen Squash, Calabaza and Variety Packs of Squash, Calabaza mixed with other items."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Squash (Calabaza)"@en;
