        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:78030500 .

gpc:10006897  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as a container used to store pencils/pens with the intent of being able to conveniently transport these items. These products could contain a variety of other stationery items such as erasers, rulers, etc. Specifically excludes pencil/pen holders typically found on top of a desk."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Pencil/Pen Cases"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:62060900 .

gpc:10006898  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as Stationery/Office Machinery products, where the user of the schema is not able to classify the products in existing bricks within the schema. Excludes all currently classified stationery and officer machinery products."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Stationery/Office Machinery - Other"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:62061200 .

gpc:10006899  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as a toy/game, where the user of the schema is not able to classify the products in existing bricks within the schema. Excludes all currently classified Toys/Games."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Toys/Games - Other"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:86011300 .

gpc:10006900  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as products that cover an opening/access. Includes products such as manhole covers, access doors, access panels, cable chambers and utility vaults. Excludes non-access coverings/panels as well as doors."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Access Covers/Panels"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:83012500 .

gpc:10006901  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as a product that is intended to help remove dirt and other unwanted materials from entering a building when a person walks over it. These products are usually outside of a building, but can also be found inside of a doorway. Specifically excludes loose rugs and mats."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Entrance Grid/Mat Frame"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:83010200 .

gpc:10006902  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as channel specifically designed to divert excess surface water. Includes drainage for roadways, buildings, rooftops. Excludes lawn drainage."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Channel (Guttering/Drainage)"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:83011400 .

gpc:10006903  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any double-sided products that may be described/observed as an item designed to secure clothing in place while remaining hidden. Can be used to fix a hem, hold a dress in place or even hold a bra strap in place. Excludes products such as double-sided tape used for stationary and arts and crafts."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Clothing/Fashion Tape"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:67010100 .

gpc:10006904  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that are kept in an automobile, used to extinguish a fire, often in an emergency situation. The container is filled with fire retardant chemicals or water that can put out a small fire. Includes products such as manually operated or automatic extinguishers. Excludes products such as environmental fire retardants and chemicals used to extinguish large fires, fire blankets, home/business fire extinguishers and fire water hoses."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Automotive Fire Extinguishers"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:77011300 .

