        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that can be described/observed as a plate used to flush the contents of a toilet cistern into a waste pipe. The flush mechanism inside the cistern is activated when a handle or button attached to the outside is pulled or pushed. The flushing mechanism can also be activated automatically by sensors removing the need for a handle or button. Includes wall-mounted Flush plates. Specifically excludes flush plates or flush mechanisms attached to a toilet or urinal cistern."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Flush Wall Plate"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:79010100 .

gpc:10007724  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that may be described/observed as a pipe fitting made to connect the water supply in your shower wall to a shower head. Excludes Shower Heads, Shower Slides Bars and Shower Sets."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Shower Arms"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:79010100 .

gpc:10007725  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that can be described/observed as a hose that extends the shower head from the shower outlet. It is specifically designed to be used in the shower. Excludes any other type of hose, tube or gutter."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Shower Hose"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:79010100 .

gpc:10007726  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that can be described/observed as a set made of a combination of the following products: shower slide bar, shower head, thermostat, etc.These sets can also be called all-in-one packs. Excludes complete shower cabins."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Shower Sets"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:79010100 .

gpc:10007727  rdf:type   gpc:Brick;
        rdfs:comment     "Includes any products that can be described/observed as a bar that is used to adjust a hand shower height. Excludes shower heads, shower arms, and shower sets."@en;
        rdfs:label       "Shower Slide Bars"@en;
        rdfs:subClassOf  gpc:79010100 .

