        rdfs:comment  "This term describes a product that is made or filled from animal hair, e.g. horsehair."@en;
        rdfs:label    "ANIMAL HAIR"@en .

gpc:30017137  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "These mattresses are made of rubber and can be made of synthetic, natural or mixed latex. Latex mattresses are manufactured by vulcanization, in that the latex mixture is poured into a steel mold and then heated. The incorporated heater pins within the mold give the characteristic holes in the latex mattress."@en;
        rdfs:label    "LATEX MATTRESS"@en .

gpc:30017138  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "Mattress to be filled with water."@en;
        rdfs:label    "MATTRESS FOR WATER BEDS"@en .

gpc:30017139  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "A combination of different biscuits in a consumer unit."@en;
        rdfs:label    "BISCUIT MIX"@en .

gpc:30017140  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "A combination of biscuits and waffle in a consumer unit."@en;
        rdfs:label    "BISCUIT WAFFLE MIX"@en .

gpc:30017141  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "A combination of biscuits and ginger bread in a consumer unit."@en;
        rdfs:label    "BISCUIT/GINGER BREAD-MIX"@en .

gpc:30017142  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "The product is a sweet primarily sold during Christmas season. Dominosteine consist of several layers, covered with a thin icing of (typically) dark chocolate. The base consists of Lebkuchen. Further layers contain jelly (e.g. from sour cherries or apricots) and either marzipan or persipan."@en;
        rdfs:label    "DOMINOSTEINE"@en .

gpc:30017143  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "This product (like gingerbread) is a traditional Christmas cookie. It is made of a soft mas, poor in or even free from flour and is often baked on Oblaten (thin wafers). These Elisenlebkuchen are the highest quality Oblaten Lebkuchen available. They must have at least 25% almonds, hazelnuts, and/or walnuts."@en;
        rdfs:label    "ELISENLEBKUCHEN"@en .

gpc:30017144  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "Wafer for garnishing and decorating ice cream, also desserts or cakes."@en;
        rdfs:label    "ICE BISCUITS"@en .

gpc:30017145  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "This product is a traditional Christmas cookie made from soft dough that has little or no flour. The ingredients usually include honey, spices such as aniseed, coriander, cloves, ginger, cardamom, and allspice."@en;
        rdfs:label    "LEBKUCHEN"@en .

gpc:30017146  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "The product is a mix of different Lebkuchen/Ginger Bread e.g. a package that includes Printen, Lebkuchen, Dominosteine, cardamom, and allspice."@en;
        rdfs:label    "LEBKUCHEN/GINGER BREAD-MIX"@en .

gpc:30017147  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "Lye Specialities are a baked specialty. They are made by immersing bread rolls in a lye solution before baking. The perhaps best known shape is the Pretzel."@en;
        rdfs:label    "LYE SPECIALTIES (OR PRETZEL-TYPE BISCUITS)"@en .

gpc:30017148  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "Aachener Printen are a type of Lebkuchen originating from the city of Aachen in Germany. The term is a protected designation of origin and so all manufacturers can be found in or near Aachen."@en;
        rdfs:label    "PRINTEN"@en .

gpc:30017149  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "The product is a type of spiced shortcrust biscuit, traditionally baked for consumption on or just before St Nicholas&apos; feast and around Christmas. Speculaas are thin, very crunchy, caramelized, slightly browned and, most significantly, have some image or figure (often from the traditional stories about St. Nicholas) stamped on the front side before baking; the back is flat. The main ingredients usually include flour, sugar, butter, pepper, cinnamon, ginger, cloves, cardamom, nutmeg."@en;
        rdfs:label    "SPECULAAS/SPECULOOS"@en .

gpc:30017150  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "This product is a special type of brown gingerbread. It is a traditional Christmas cookie. It is made from a malleable dough (partly thickness) mainly consist of flour and honey or other viscous sweetener.&#160;"@en;
        rdfs:label    "SPITZKUCHEN"@en .

gpc:30017151  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:label  "CHOCOLATE/FRUIT PASTE COMBINATION"@en .

gpc:30017152  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:label  "FRUIT FILLING"@en .

gpc:30017153  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "Moulded soles are primarily for sports and leisure shoes with a anatomically shaped footbed.&#160;"@en;
        rdfs:label    "MOULDED SOLE"@en .

gpc:30017154  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:comment  "Smooth soles are primarily for sports and leisure shoes without a anatomically shaped footbed.&#160;"@en;
        rdfs:label    "SMOOTH SOLE"@en .

gpc:30017155  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:label  "BALLET/DANCE"@en .

gpc:30017156  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
        rdfs:label  "TRACK AND FIELD"@en .

gpc:30017157  rdf:type  gpc:AttributeValue;
